{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他此刻在依恋里感到少见的安心，心里也柔软下来。前面的亲近曾一次次安顿他，让他对这份感情多了些信任。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他短暂体验到，自己可以在依恋中少些防备。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文多次写到亲近真实地安顿他，听感又支持短暂放松防备的体验，因此这条因果较顺。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选11\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他此刻感到，喜欢本身就有分量，心里生出柔和的满足。先前已尝过渴望的甜意，这一次，那份满足也让他平静下来。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他短暂体验到，渴望既牵引他靠近，也能让他平静下来。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前文已明确他能从渴望本身得到满足，但把这一刻理解为平静的满足，仍是合理而非唯一的延伸。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选2\",\n        \"候选10\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5c89b7b7-215e-4491-8d28-45d8b7b85127", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T022941020937Z", "elapsed_seconds": 227.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:33:28.400732+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fbf4a6771c888d3c3bdcf93229d237592d213a6c5b52f0dd0c626331544faae6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06